# ID       : ABOP-014
# Name     : Sierpiński gasket
# Source   : chapter 1, book page 11, Fig. 1.10b
# Formalism: deterministic turtle string
# Parse    : pass
# Execute  : pass
#
# Original ABOP:
# ABOP | ω : Fr
# ABOP | p1    : Fl -> Fr+Fl+Fr
# ABOP | p2    : Fr -> Fl-Fr-Fl
